{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13105190","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13105190","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1310519001:1":{"text":"저기요! 우리 말 들려요? 우린 악마도 악당도 아니에요!","source_cn":"喂，你们能听到我讲话吗？我们不是恶魔，也不是坏人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0F8AE61C60130D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310519002:1":{"text":"다 봤어요. 여러분이 두 아이를 구했잖아요. 여러분은 영웅이에요!","source_cn":"我们都看到了，你们救了那两个小孩子，你们是英雄的战士！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42F4BC19947B2DE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310519003:1":{"text":"그들을 지키고... 악마와... 싸움에서...","source_cn":"保护他们……和恶魔……战斗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBD4073F49034C02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310519004:1":{"text":"물러날 수... 없어...","source_cn":"绝不能……后退……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x180D8255E61EBFEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1310519004":{"text":"물러날 수... 없어...","source_cn":"绝不能……后退……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x180D8255E61EBFEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1310519005:1":{"text":"이제 알겠어요. 방금 본 환영은 그들의 강한 집념이 남긴 것이었어요!","source_cn":"我明白了，刚才看到的幻象就是他们强烈的执念所留存下来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A19B536FFCC6BED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1310519006:1":{"text":"죽은 지 오래되었지만 아이들을 지키려는 마음을 여전히 간직하고 있었던 거예요...","source_cn":"就算他们死去了那么久，也还想着要保护那些小孩子呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x425EA1E2D2C0CDFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1310519009:1":{"text":"죽어... 우리가... 죽어...? 우리가... 이미 죽었다니...","source_cn":"死……我们……死了……？……我们……已经死了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5E2855BE8C3BD98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1310519010:1":{"text":"전쟁은... 이겼나? 악마는... 악마...","source_cn":"战争……胜利了吗？恶魔呢……恶魔……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0AED39B145B7BC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1310519011:1":{"text":"걱정 마세요. 여러분 덕분에 악마도 봉인되었어요!","source_cn":"放心吧，你们胜利了！恶魔也被封印起来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14A033181A0E8182","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1310519012:1":{"text":"그리고 2천 년이 지난 지금도 사람들은 여러분을 잊지 않